    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musengwa Katonda yaakoba ati: “Iwe omuntu, funayo empiima endhogi ogikozese okwemwaku enviiri dhoonadhoona n'ekirevu. Bw'omala, funayo minzaani, ogiteeku enviiri edho odhipime era omale odhaawulemu ebitundu bisatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekitundu ekisooka oidha kukyokera mu kibuga ng'enaku edh'okuzingiza ekibuga ekyo dhiwoireku. Ekitundu ekyokubiri oidha kukigema mu ngalo oje ng'okisalasala n'empiima obukutukutu okwezunguluza ekibuga. Ate ekitundu ekyokusatu ekinaaba kisigairegho, oidha kukisansaaniza mu mpewo ekitwalirize. Nze mwene ndisowolayo empiima mu kiruutu yaaja ng'ebingirira enviiri dho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku nviiri edho oidha kulekaghooku butono buti, obusibe mu katu ku igemo ly'ekanzu yo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku obwo oidha kutoolaku obundi obusuule mu muliro buye, buveeku omuliro gusansaanire eighanga lya Isiraeli lyonalyona.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Musengwa Katonda yaakoba ati: “Ekibuga kino Yerusalemu nakita ghagati agh'ensi dhoonadhoona, olwo amaghanga goonagoona gaaba nga gakyezungulwire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye abantu baamu baakola bwa bibi, baadheemera ebiragiro byange okusinga n'abamaghanga agandi, baaloba okugondera amateeka gange okusinga n'ab'ensi edhibeezungulwire. Baava ku mateeka gange, baaloba okujiira ku biragiro byange. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nze Musengwa Katonda nkoba nti: Muli babi okusinga n'abamaghanga agabeezungulwire, kuba muloba okujiira ku mateeka gange oba okugondera ebiragiro byange, aye mwajiira ku mpisa edh'abamaghanga agandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale ni mubone eno, buti nze Musengwa Katonda waimwe, zeena ndi muzigu ye muli, era ndibasalira imwe omusango naababonereza ng'abamaghanga agabeezungulwire boonaboona babona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era olw'ebyenhinhalwa byonabyona bye mukola, ndibakola kye ntakolangaku era kye ntaliirayo kukola kabiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LAM.4.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kul 4:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Abazaire b'omu Yerusalemu balirya abaana baibwe, n'abaana baalya abazaire baibwe. Ndibasalira imwe omusango gwabasinga naababonereza, era naasansaaniza ku ndhuyi dhoonadhoona abo abaliba basigairegho nga balamu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Agho ni, nze Musengwa Katonda ndayira nti nga bwendi omulamu, bino bye nkoba ku imwe ab'omu Yerusalemu: mwayonoona eisinzizo lyange nga mulikoleramu ebibi byaimwe byonabyona ebyenhinhalwa. Kale ndibatirimbula, naaloba kusaasiraku naire omulala ati oba okumugemerwa ekivunika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndibaawulamu ebitundu bisatu: Abaliba mu kitundu ekisooka mulifa endwaire era mwalambuka endhala. Abaliba mu kitundu ekyokubiri muliitibwa mu ntalo edhiryezungulula ekibuga kyaimwe. Ate abaliba mu kitundu ekyokusatu ndibasansaaniza ku ndhuyi dhoonadhoona, empewo yaabatwaliriza. Era ndisowolayo empiima mu kiruutu yaaja ng'ebabingirira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Obusungu bwange butyo bwe bulibaidhira. Ndibamaliraku ekiruyi kyange, memale naasiima. Era bwendimala okubamaliraku ekiruyi kyange, olwo mulimanha nga nze Musengwa Katonda, ninze ndhogeiza enkikidi imwe abantu bange ye mwandeetera okuba nayo olw'obutaba beesigwa ye ndi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekibuga kyaimwe Yerusalemu ndikifuula kifulukwa, era kyaba ekivumo eri amaghanga goonagoona agabeezungulwire, n'eri ababise boonaboona ababitagho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Bwendibasalira omusango ni mbabonereza nga ndi mu busungu obubitirivu, olwo ab'amaghanga agabeezungulwire balitya inho. Mulifuuka kivumo era eky'okuyeeyereza ye bali, era mwafuuka akamanhiso ak'okubalabula. Nze Musengwa Katonda, ninze ndhogeire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndirekeza emere ye mubairenga mufuna, olwo endhala yaabaluma, mwawulira obulumi ng'oti n'obw'obusaale obuliku obusagwa, obulasiibwa okwidha okubazikiriza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.6.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kwol 6:8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Era ndibasindikira endhala n'ensolo enkambwe edh'omu nsiko, byabaitaku abaana baimwe. Naabasindikira n'endwaire, n'obutemo, n'entalo, byabaidhira okubaita. Nze Musengwa Katonda, ninze ndhogeire.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
